{
  "flow": "turn",
  "about": [
    "One case = a seeded day, one incoming message, and what must be true afterwards.",
    "Most cases are the owner's real chat of 22 September 2026: the day that produced",
    "docs/AGENT.md. The rest are the ordinary turns that must not regress.",
    "Every case also carries an implicit check: a turn may never change a row from an",
    "earlier day. Times are Asia/Dubai."
